た、幼い頃に双子の姉を事故で失っていて、彼女の研究はそのことと関係がある様子。一人は寂しいけど、ときどき死んだ姉が励ましてくれる気がして大丈夫……がんばり屋さんです。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"霊感は皆無で、極度にそっち系の話しは嫌がります。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在、人型ロボットを開発中･･･莫大な部費を学園の経費から（内緒で）捻出中･･･。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10751","sourceWorkId":"24012","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"きさらの異父姉妹の一人（妹）。 科学者の家系で育ち、本人も発明家であり勉強家。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉妹の中では珍しくしっかり者でマジメな性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"周囲の女の子たちとは趣味が合わず、なかなか仲良くできないのが悩みの種。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃に双子の姉を事故で亡くしていて、彼女の研究はそのことと関係がある様子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一人は寂しいけど、時々死んだ姉が励ましてくれる気がして大丈夫……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"霊感は皆無で、そっち系の話しは極度に苦手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「一間さんなら大丈夫って信じてますけどぉ…… 内視鏡はアソコに入れるんです。モニター以外は見ちゃダメですからね？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"48066"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好きな食べ物","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"48066","value":"無駄のないもの"},{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"48066","value":"開発と実検"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"73 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10751","sourceWorkId":"24012","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"d","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10751","sourceWorkId":"24012","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"146 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10751","sourceWorkId":"24012","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"78 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10751","sourceWorkId":"24012","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"53 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10751","sourceWorkId":"24012","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"46 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10751","sourceWorkId":"24012","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/db/db49c633d49f5243e26a08b3c7d6b0cb97dcbb7a7785171214a7e52acf212571.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/57/57ab50d6245176cf1fc9080558c9d4e97e58f58bf020e670d60e6177ae682382.webp","width":141,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"風花ましろ","creatorId":"vndb:s5762","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5762","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5762","name":"中野 純花","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:187471:48066:20833:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c50481","characterName":"瑠璃唐草 ひかり","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"48067","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"187471"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10752"],"vndbCharacterId":"c50481"},"originalCharacterName":"瑠璃唐草 ひかり","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"73"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"D"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"146"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"78"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"53"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"21g"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Favorite food: Offerings"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Watching horror movies"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Weight: 21 grams"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Akari's older twin sister and Kisara's younger half-sister. Hikari died in an accident a while ago and watches over Akari as a ghost. Unfortunately her sister can't see her like everyone else can and is afraid of ghosts."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c50481"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"あかりの双子の姉で幼い頃に交通事故で死んでいます。それ以来、あかりを守り側にいました。幽霊でも双子の妹がいて寂しくないせいか、彼女はとても性格が良い娘に成長（？）しています。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、きさらは幼い頃から彼女のことが見えて、さらに話しをすることが出来ます。なので、きさらとは仲良しです。さらにきさらの夫・主人公も彼女を見たり話しをすることが出来るので、ひかりは勝手に“運命の人”と決めているようです。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"でも、普段は妹のあかりのことが一番大事。彼女に幸せになって貰うことだけを考えています（それが未練で成仏できない）。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10752","sourceWorkId":"24012","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"きさらの異父姉妹の一人（妹）。 あかりの双子の姉で、交通事故で亡くなっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幽霊になってからも あかり のそばで彼女を見守り、彼女の幸せを祈っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも一緒で寂しくないせいか、幽霊だけどとても性格が良い娘に成長した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"きさらは幼い頃から彼女が見えて話をすることも出来るので、仲良しの間柄。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公も会話でき、ひかりは勝手に“運命の人”と決めてしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あかりに手を出したら承知しませんからね？ 末代まで祟りますよ？　あっ、でも。幽霊の私となら不倫じゃないと思うんです。」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"48067"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好きな食べ物","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"48067","value":"お供え"},{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"48067","value":"映画鑑賞（ホラー映画）"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"73 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10752","sourceWorkId":"24012","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"d","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10752","sourceWorkId":"24012","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"146 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10752","sourceWorkId":"24012","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"78 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10752","sourceWorkId":"24012","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"53 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10752","sourceWorkId":"24012","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e3/e373366124981d994d258464df5a1f741fdfeec33ef137c014f4aceda31c70ea.webp",