},{"spoiler":false,"text":"※本人は気付いていませんが、ギャンブラーとしての才能は凄まじく、ア○ギ、カイ○レベルです。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10753","sourceWorkId":"24012","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"きさらの異父姉妹の一人（姉）。 学園理事のお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"花那璃学園の教師で、女子寮の寮長も勤めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美しく誰からも好かれており、教師としては優秀だが、天然系でズレたところも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公をあっさり女子寮に入れちゃうほど世間知らず。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また騙されやすく、「寮に飾る絵を買ったの、ゴッホの弟でコッポさんっていう絵描きさんなの。なんと1億円が100万円だったわ！」と、あっさりだまし取られてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「私は結婚できないんじゃなくて、しないの！　ホントよ、本当なんだからね？　ううっ、その目……疑ってるでしょ？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"48068"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好きな食べ物","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"48068","value":"お酒"},{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"48068","value":"買い物"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"92 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10753","sourceWorkId":"24012","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"f","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10753","sourceWorkId":"24012","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"170 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10753","sourceWorkId":"24012","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"95 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10753","sourceWorkId":"24012","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"64 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10753","sourceWorkId":"24012","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"64 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10753","sourceWorkId":"24012","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/89/89a51cdbe40cfa1a93a2407ee476ebe7a6d236c155d4eac27c7b5d89f68a5c70.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/84/84b336d88248502d6c8fe27d1f94862b5e5babd9e407fa313a8e4bb3167d388a.webp","width":132,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"ありかわ真奈","creatorId":"vndb:s5761","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5761","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5761","name":"ありかわ真奈","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:187471:48068:21127:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c51667","characterName":"プニーナ・マルナ・フェアケル","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"48065","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"187471"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10750"],"vndbCharacterId":"c51667"},"originalCharacterName":"プニーナ・マルナ・フェアケル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"95"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"E"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"162"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"90"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"70"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"64"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Favorite food: Sweet food, fried food, meat... everything!"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Dieting"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kisara's younger half-sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her three sizes and weight vary depending on how much she eats and exercises. Eating a lot will cause her to get fat. (Ecchi activities also cause her 3 sizes and weight to vary)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Variant 1: Weight: 50kg Bust-Waist-Hips: 66-48-75cm (B Cup)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Variant 2: Weight: 59kg Bust-Waist-Hips: 90-48-81cm (K Cup)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Variant 3: Weight: 64kg Bust-Waist-Hips: 95-70-90cm (E Cup)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"(Variant 3 is her default statistics.)"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c51667"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ドイツ生まれ。まん丸でふくよかな女の子でした。寝子草学園には交換留学生として来日。この時、主人公に優しくされて以来、プニーナは密かに恋心を抱いていました。その後、留学期間も終わって母国へ帰国……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"失恋のショックで痩せたプニーナは、モデル、俳優としてスカウトされプロデビューしています。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"物語では、プロデビュー後、撮影のために来日したところからスタート。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"痩せて美しくなったプニーナですが、油断すると直ぐに太ります。また、運動（エッチ）すると痩せる体質に！彼女のマネージャーを押し付けられた主人公は？！"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10750","sourceWorkId":"24012","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"きさらの異父姉妹の一人（妹）。 ドイツ生まれのふくよかだった女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"以前 交換留学生として現れ、主人公に優しくされたことで恋心を抱いてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その後、留学期間が終わって帰国することになり、失恋のショックで激痩せ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おかげでモデル・俳優としてスカウトされ、プロデビューすることに。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今回 撮影のために来日した彼女は、主人公にマネージャーを依頼。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"油断するとすぐに太ってしまうため、運動（エッチ）して痩せさせるお仕事に励むことに。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「大丈夫、大丈夫。心配いりません。 プニは食べても太らない体質なのですからぁ～！」（←翌日、5キロ太った）"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"48065"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好きな食べ物","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"48065","value":"甘いモノ、揚げ物、お肉、……全部っ！"},{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"48065","value":"ダイエット"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"95 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10750","sourceWorkId":"24012","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"e","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10750","sourceWorkId":"24012","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"162 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10750","sourceWorkId":"24012","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10750","sourceWorkId":"24012","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"70 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10750","sourceWorkId":